#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:1
msgid ""
"Chapter 5: Biomedicine in Announcement 48, guarding domestic ownership of "
"reusable cell/gene therapy and siRNA platforms while keeping individual "
"cures and global licensing open."
msgstr ""
"第5章：第48号公告中的生物医药规则：守住通用型细胞与基因治疗（CGT）及小核酸（siRNA）底层研发平台的境内所有权，同时让具体创新药与全球对外授权畅通无阻。"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:5
msgid "05. Living Code: Gene Platforms and Shared Cures"
msgstr "05. 生命的代码：基因平台与共享良方"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:8
msgid "Guarding the Printing Press While Sharing the Books"
msgstr "留住活字印刷机，让良方典籍传遍天下"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:11
msgid ""
"Artificial intelligence writes in floating-point numbers; modern biomedicine"
" writes in the four-letter alphabet of life (``A, C, G, U/T``). Over the "
"past decade, Chinese biotech teams have advanced from making off-patent "
"generics to inventing reusable **cell and gene therapy (CGT)** engines and "
"**small-interfering RNA (siRNA)** platforms that silence disease-causing "
"genes before harmful proteins form."
msgstr ""
"如果说人工智能是用浮点数谱写思想，现代生物医药便是用生命的四字母密码（ ``A, C, G, U/T`` "
"）编写疗法。过去十年间，中国生物科技团队已从早年的专利到期仿制药车间，跨越式成长为原创底层平台的发明者，构建起可反复复用的  "
"**细胞与基因治疗（CGT）**  研发引擎，以及能够在致病蛋白合成之前精准沉默致病基因的  **小干扰核酸（siRNA）**  技术平台。"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:13 ../../book/biomedicine.rst:18
msgid ""
"A cell, DNA, RNA and laboratory tools make the subject tangible. A reusable "
"medicine-development platform differs from a particular treatment."
msgstr "细胞、DNA、RNA和实验工具让主题更具体。可复用的药物研发平台与某一种治疗不同。"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:20
msgid ""
"The draft distinguishes ownership of a reusable medicine-development "
"platform from specific drug projects. It proposes limits on covered platform"
" ownership transfers, with explicit exclusions for licensing and other "
"activities. Those exclusions concern these entries; medicines and clinical "
"trials can still face other rules. `CN-A1, 262704J and 262705J "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"草案区分可复用药物研发平台的所有权与具体药物项目，拟限制所列平台的所有权转移，并明确排除许可等活动。这些排除只针对相关条目，药品及临床试验仍可能受其他规则约束。"
" `CN-A1, 262704J and 262705J "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:22
msgid ""
"Picture a foundational CGT or siRNA platform as a custom **printing press** "
"perfected over ten years (delivery vectors, chemical stabilization recipes, "
"and modular design rules capable of printing twenty future therapies). "
"Picture a specific clinical drug candidate as **one book** printed on that "
"press:"
msgstr ""
"不妨将一套十年磨一剑的 CGT 或 siRNA 底层技术平台想象成一台定制的  **活字印刷机**  "
"，其中凝聚着递送载体、化学修饰稳定配方与模块化序列设计规则，足以在未来源源不断印制出二十种新疗法；而某一款进入临床管线的具体候选新药，则是这台印刷机印出的"
"  **一本书**  ："

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Platform ownership transfer is proposed prohibited (262704J and "
"262705J).** The draft targets overseas ownership transfers of the specified "
"reusable platforms, with explicit exclusions described below. The new "
"prohibition is a proposal, not an already-final rule introduced by "
"Announcement 48. `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
" **平台所有权转移拟禁止（262704J、262705J）。**  "
"草案针对指定可复用平台的境外所有权转移并设排除。它不是第48号公告已经正式实施的新禁令。 `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Out-licensing, contract manufacturing, and single-drug partnerships stay "
"open:** Three explicit notes under both entries carve out overseas **out-"
"licensing** (``对外授权许可``), **outsourced R&D and manufacturing (CRO/CDMO)** "
"where ownership remains domestic, and all pipeline data needed for "
"**preclinical research, clinical trials, manufacturing, quality control, "
"regulatory approval, and commercialization of specific drug candidates** in "
"global business-development deals `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_."
" Only a sham \"perpetual buyout license\" that strips domestic ownership in "
"substance crosses the red line."
msgstr ""
" **对外授权许可、委托研发生产与单药出海合作全面放行：**  两项条目下设的三条明确说明，特意豁免了技术所有权留在境内的  **对外授权许可**  （"
" ``对外授权许可`` ）、  **委托研发与生产（CRO/CDMO）**  ，以及跨国医药商务拓展（BD）合作中围绕  "
"**特定候选药物开展临床前研究、临床试验、生产制造、质量控制、注册申报及商业化上市**  所需的全部管线技术资料 `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
" 。唯有那种名义上叫“许可”、实质上永久买断并掏空境内所有权的变相转让，才会触碰红线。"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:27
msgid "Undisclosed Biological Targets and Biosecurity Walls"
msgstr "全球未公开全新靶点与生物安全红线"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:30
msgid ""
"Two **proposed restricted** entries (``262705X`` and ``262706X``) cover "
"Chinese-owned technology for discovering and validating **wholly new "
"therapeutic targets** in CGT and siRNA medicine, defined strictly as "
"molecular targets **never previously disclosed anywhere in the world** in "
"patents, journals, public databases, industry filings, or conferences `CN-A1"
" "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_."
" Even there, **Footnote 3** provides **automatic-licensing facilitation** "
"for public-health emergencies, humanitarian relief, international "
"collaborative research using overseas resources, and overseas out-licensing "
"`CN-A1, note 3 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"另有两项  **拟限制出口**  条目（ ``262705X`` 与 ``262706X`` ）聚焦于中国自主研发的 CGT 与 siRNA  "
"**全新治疗靶点发现与确证技术** ，其范围被严格界定为  "
"**此前从未在全世界任何专利、学术期刊、公共数据库、行业披露或学术会议上公开过的全新分子靶点**  `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" 。即便在这一领域，  **注释 3**  也专门为突发公共卫生事件应急、人道主义救援、利用境外资源开展国际科研合作以及对外授权许可提供了  "
"**自动许可便利化通道**  `CN-A1, note 3 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"
" 。"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:32
msgid ""
"The fifth entry (``267302J``, proposed prohibited) is a pure **biosecurity "
"wall** against artificial genetic modification and directed serial-passage "
"methods that enhance pathogen virulence or accelerate controlled pathogen "
"evolution `CN-A1, 267302J "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_,"
" paralleling Category 1 pathogen controls and ``EAR 744.4`` on the US side "
"`EAR774 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/774>`_ `EAR744 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/744>`_. *(Bulk human genomic data, "
"meanwhile, faces separate data-security rules in both countries, including "
"the US Justice Department's Data Security Program `DOJ "
"<https://www.justice.gov/nsd/data-security>`_.)*"
msgstr ""
"第五项生物医药条目（ ``267302J`` ，拟禁止出口）则是一道纯粹的  **生物安全防火墙**  "
"，严禁出口通过人工基因改造或受控连续传代等方式增强病原体毒力、实现规模化毒力维持或加速病原体定向进化的技术 `CN-A1, 267302J "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_，这与美国《出口管理条例》第一类病原体管制及"
" ``EAR 744.4`` 生物武器最终用途禁令遥相对应 `EAR774 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/774>`_ `EAR744 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/744>`_ 。  "
"*（与此同时，大批量人类基因组数据在中美两国均另受专门的数据安全法规约束，例如美国司法部实施的“数据安全计划”*  `DOJ "
"<https://www.justice.gov/nsd/data-security>`_  *。）* "

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:34
msgid "What This Means for the Two Teams"
msgstr "这对两支团队意味着什么"

#: ../../book/biomedicine.rst:37
msgid ""
"In medicine, the shared workbench involves platforms, research and "
"particular treatments. The distinctions above help us ask which "
"collaboration a rule reaches and which it leaves possible. We do not "
"transfer the AI game scores to medicine or assume that open access alone "
"establishes patient safety."
msgstr ""
"医学中的共享工作台涉及平台、研究与特定治疗。上述区别帮助判断规则触及哪些合作、保留哪些可能。我们不把AI游戏得分套用到医学，也不认为开放本身就能证明患者安全。"

msgid "The two teams' starting point is in :ref:`shared-workbench-story`."
msgstr "两队的起点见 :ref:`shared-workbench-story`。"
